  In my PC, TMUX server has already freed memory, but it was still stashed by `ptmalloc` (glibc.so).
  
  My solution is:
  
  1. `sudo gdb -p <pid of tmux>`
  
  2. Inside GDB: `call malloc_trim(0)`
  
  
